[94.621, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Attempt B missed too — but something more important undermines the\r\n"]
[95.521, "o", "  whole method: I don't actually have a working oracle. The console\r\n"]
[96.421, "o", "  preview has been blank on every check, including before I changed\r\n"]
[97.321, "o", "  anything. I cannot tell a hit from a miss.\r\n"]
[98.521, "o", "\r\n"]
[99.071, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220m\u001b[1mSo I'm going to stop guessing — further attempts are unfalsifiable.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[99.971, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220mI could have already hit the right setting and have no way to know.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[100.571, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mwaiting for you…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[103.771, "o", "\r\n"]
