[113.141, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[114.941, "o", "\r\n"]
[115.491, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Attempt 1 is running: power cycle → F11 spam in both serial encodings →\r\n"]
[116.391, "o", "  Enter on the (invisible) first menu entry. Each attempt is ~3–4 minutes\r\n"]
[117.291, "o", "  with an unambiguous oracle.\r\n"]
[118.491, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Iterating…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(14m 51s · ↓ 5.2k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[120.491, "o", "\r\n"]
[121.041, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m All four menu positions came up empty — the boot entries were wiped by\r\n"]
[121.941, "o", "  the defaults reset. So: remount the installer ISO from gpu-01's share,\r\n"]
[122.841, "o", "  and use this same F11 machinery to pick the UEFI virtual CD.\r\n"]
[124.141, "o", "\r\n"]
[124.691, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mBash  ipmitool … raw  # mount installer ISO over SMB, boot the virtual CD\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[125.391, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Booting installer…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(6m 20s · ↓ 4.1k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[127.391, "o", "\r\n"]
[127.941, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;114mRoot shell on hyperviseur\u001b[0m — booted the installer off virtual media, added\r\n"]
[128.841, "o", "  gpu-01's key, SSH'd in. And a real diagnosis at last: the installer\r\n"]
[129.741, "o", "  came up \u001b[38;5;220mLEGACY-BOOTED\u001b[0m while the NVMe holds a UEFI install.\r\n"]
[130.841, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Load Optimized Defaults flipped the firmware to legacy/CSM — that's the\r\n"]
[131.741, "o", "  whole « boot loop ». Not a brick.\r\n"]
[133.041, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Installing NixOS with the bootloader hardened for the blindness:\r\n"]
[133.941, "o", "  GRUB i386-pc on the NVMe for the current legacy mode, GRUB x86_64-efi\r\n"]
[134.841, "o", "  in /boot for whenever the firmware is put back — so no firmware mode\r\n"]
[135.741, "o", "  can strand this machine again.\r\n"]
[137.041, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Installing…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(11m 03s · ↓ 6.8k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[139.041, "o", "\r\n"]
[139.591, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;114mhyperviseur is up on NixOS\u001b[0m, healthy, GitOps-managed — and no longer\r\n"]
[140.491, "o", "  invisible: GRUB and the Linux console both render over the serial\r\n"]
[141.391, "o", "  link now, so there is a real recovery channel.\r\n"]
[142.591, "o", "\r\n"]
[143.141, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mThe BIOS screen was never seen once.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
